{
  "version": 2,
  "description": "R5 跨会话记忆召回评测集。种子记忆代表上一段会话留下的结论；问题只换说法、不出现类名，考的是语义召回，不是关键词匹配。v2 增加近似 subject、中文歧义与跨 rev 三类难例。",
  "seed": [
    {
      "key": "pay_entry",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "支付回调入口是 PayNotifyController.notify，之后进入 PayService",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.pay.controller.PayNotifyController"]
    },
    {
      "key": "pay_gap",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "支付链路在 OrderClient 处跨服务，本图没有下游",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.pay.client.OrderClient"]
    },
    {
      "key": "order_entry",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "下单入口是 OrderController.createOrder，先校验库存再创建订单",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.trade.controller.OrderController"]
    },
    {
      "key": "stock_deduct",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "库存扣减在 StockServiceImpl.deduct，失败会抛库存不足异常",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.stock.service.impl.StockServiceImpl"]
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_filter",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "登录态由 AuthFilter 校验，token 从 Authorization 头取",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.auth.AuthFilter"]
    },
    {
      "key": "cart_clear",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "订单创建成功后会调用 CartClient.clear 清空购物车",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.trade.client.CartClient"]
    },
    {
      "key": "user_cache",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "用户信息先查 UserCache，缓存未命中才回源 UserServiceImpl",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.user.cache.UserCache"]
