      "text": "退款流程从 RefundController 进，调用 RefundService 后发 MQ 通知下游",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.pay.controller.RefundController"]
    },
    {
      "key": "search_index",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "商品搜索索引由 SearchSyncJob 定时同步，延迟约 5 分钟",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.search.job.SearchSyncJob"]
    },
    {
      "key": "order_status",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "订单状态流转在 OrderStateMachine.transit，超时关单由定时任务触发",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.trade.state.OrderStateMachine"]
    },
    {
      "key": "pay_timeout",
      "type": "FACT",
      "text": "支付超时时间是 30 分钟，配置在 PaymentProperties.timeout",
      "subjectUids": ["com.hmall.pay.config.PaymentProperties"]
